Title           Virtio Entropy Device
Version         OPENSTEP for Mach 4.2, VirtioRNG 0.1
Description     Experimental entropy driver for QEMU's transitional virtio PCI device. Includes a bounded command-line reader. Install at / and follow README.txt to activate and cold-boot. Does not feed PRNGD or replace system randomness interfaces.
DefaultLocation /
DiskName        VirtioRNG
Relocatable     NO
Application     NO
LibrarySubdirectory Standard
InstallOnly     YES
DisableStop     YES
LongFilenames   NO
NeedsAuthorization YES
